OL,3,ATech treating AI like humans is
OL,4,A'mistaken and misguided', Microsoft
OL,5,Aboss tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FMicrosoft's head of AI has described
OL,8,Frival tech firm's approach of treating
OL,9,Flike it's human as "misguided" as he
OL,10,Fwarned against creating a technology
OL,11,Fhumanity cannot control.
OL,13,FSpeaking to the BBC, Mustafa Suleyman
OL,14,Fsaid it is "right" that people are
OL,15,Fconcerned or alarmed, but there are
OL,16,F"very practical things that we can do
OL,17,Fto add additional guardrails and
OL,18,Fcontrols to how these models are
OL,19,Fdeveloped".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
