OL,3,ATech treating AI like humans is
OL,4,A'mistaken and misguided', Microsoft
OL,5,Aboss tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut he warned tech companies and world
OL,8,Fleaders must be "aligned" moving
OL,9,Fforward if they are to create a safe
OL,10,Fand "controllable" version of AI for
OL,11,Fthe future.
OL,13,FThe comments are the latest in a series
OL,14,Fof stark warnings from the AI industry
OL,15,Fon the possible dangers of the
OL,16,Ftechnology.
